{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "shots": [
        {
          "dur": 3400,
          "bg": [
            "#fff3e0",
            "#ffd9b0"
          ],
          "text": "Dr. Amara: \"Cuma luka gores kok — tapi kalau kotor sedikit saja, bisa infeksi.\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/amara_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.09999999999999998,
                0.52
              ],
              "to": [
                0.3,
                0.52
              ],
              "scale": 0.42
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "dur": 3200,
          "bg": [
            "#fff3e0",
            "#ffd9b0"
          ],
          "text": "Dr. Amara: \"Untungnya tubuh kita punya 'pasukan' sendiri yang langsung siaga begitu ada luka.\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/amara_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.12,
                0.52
              ],
              "to": [
                0.32,
                0.52
              ],
              "scale": 0.42
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "dur": 2600,
          "bg": [
            "#f7c8a8",
            "#3f8f7f"
          ],
          "text": "...zoom masuk ke luka. Warna berubah. Skala berubah. Selamat datang di dunia mikroskopis.",
          "ease": "inOut"
        },
        {
          "dur": 3200,
          "bg": [
            "#e7f6ee",
            "#bfe8d2"
          ],
          "text": "RIA: \"Woy, bangun! Ada celah masuk di lengan, bakteri udah nyusup duluan. Lo satu-satunya yang deket lokasi!\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/ria_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.72,
                0.75
              ],
              "to": [
                0.72,
                0.35
              ],
              "scale": 0.3
            },
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/hero_macrophage_idle.png",
              "from": [
                0.3,
                0.6
              ],
              "to": [
                0.38,
                0.55
              ],
              "scale": 0.3
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "onboarding",
      "shots": [
        {
          "dur": 3000,
          "bg": [
            "#fff3e0",
            "#ffd9b0"
          ],
          "text": "Dr. Amara: \"Tenang ya. Dari dalam sana, ada pasukan yang bertugas jaga siang-malam.\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/amara_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.09999999999999998,
                0.52
              ],
              "to": [
                0.3,
                0.52
              ],
              "scale": 0.42
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "dur": 2600,
          "bg": [
            "#f7c8a8",
            "#3f8f7f"
          ],
          "text": "Kamu tidak tahu di tubuh siapa kamu berada. Kamu hanya tahu satu hal: kalau kamu kalah, Inang mati.",
          "ease": "inOut"
        },
        {
          "dur": 3000,
          "bg": [
            "#e7f6ee",
            "#bfe8d2"
          ],
          "text": "RIA: \"Namaku RIA — aku jaringan komunikasi seluruh pasukan imun. Dengar aku, dan kita selamatkan Inang bersama.\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/ria_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.6,
                0.75
              ],
              "to": [
                0.6,
                0.35
              ],
              "scale": 0.3
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "dur": 2800,
          "bg": [
            "#e7f6ee",
            "#bfe8d2"
          ],
          "text": "RIA: \"Bakteri di depan! Bergerak dengan menyeret arena, serang otomatis saat dekat. Gerak sekarang, gih!\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/ria_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.8,
                0.75
              ],
              "to": [
                0.8,
                0.35
              ],
              "scale": 0.22
            },
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/enemy_virus.png",
              "from": [
                1.1,
                0.5
              ],
              "to": [
                0.6,
                0.5
              ],
              "scale": 0.26
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "brief_bab_luka",
      "shots": [
        {
          "dur": 3200,
          "bg": [
            "#fff3e0",
            "#ffd9b0"
          ],
          "text": "Dr. Amara: \"Lukanya kecil, tapi harus dijaga tetap bersih — biar tidak infeksi.\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/amara_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.09999999999999998,
                0.52
              ],
              "to": [
                0.3,
                0.52
              ],
              "scale": 0.42
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "dur": 3200,
          "bg": [
            "#e7f6ee",
            "#bfe8d2"
          ],
          "text": "RIA: \"Gerbangnya kebuka! Bakteri nyusup lewat goresan. Bersihkan 25 penyusup — tunjukkan siapa penjaga tubuh ini!\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/ria_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.72,
                0.75
              ],
              "to": [
                0.72,
                0.35
              ],
              "scale": 0.3
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "brief_bab_demam",
      "shots": [
        {
          "dur": 3200,
          "bg": [
            "#fff3e0",
            "#ffd9b0"
          ],
          "text": "Dr. Amara: \"Suhunya naik jadi 38.5 — ini normal kok, badan lagi kerja ekstra ngelawan virus flu-nya.\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/amara_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.09999999999999998,
                0.52
              ],
              "to": [
                0.3,
                0.52
              ],
              "scale": 0.42
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "dur": 3200,
          "bg": [
            "#e7f6ee",
            "#bfe8d2"
          ],
          "text": "RIA: \"Denger itu? Suhu naik artinya sinyal darurat baru dikirim ke seluruh badan. Bala bantuan datang — tapi musuh makin ganas. Siap-siap!\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/ria_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.72,
                0.75
              ],
              "to": [
                0.72,
                0.35
              ],
              "scale": 0.3
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "brief_bab_racun",
      "shots": [
        {
          "dur": 3200,
          "bg": [
            "#fff3e0",
            "#ffd9b0"
          ],
          "text": "Dr. Amara: \"Sepertinya ada yang tidak beres dengan makanannya semalam. Kita bantu tubuhnya membersihkan diri.\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/amara_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.09999999999999998,
                0.52
              ],
              "to": [
                0.3,
                0.52
              ],
              "scale": 0.42
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "dur": 3200,
          "bg": [
            "#e7f6ee",
            "#bfe8d2"
          ],
          "text": "RIA: \"Racun ikut masuk bareng makanan! Musuh datang lebih cepat dan acak — hajar di Lambung sebelum menyebar!\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/ria_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.72,
                0.75
              ],
              "to": [
                0.72,
                0.35
              ],
              "scale": 0.3
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "brief_bab_alergi",
      "shots": [
        {
          "dur": 3200,
          "bg": [
            "#fff3e0",
            "#ffd9b0"
          ],
          "text": "Dr. Amara: \"Reaksi alerginya cukup kuat — tubuhnya menyerang sesuatu yang sebenarnya tidak berbahaya.\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/amara_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.09999999999999998,
                0.52
              ],
              "to": [
                0.3,
                0.52
              ],
              "scale": 0.42
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "dur": 3200,
          "bg": [
            "#e7f6ee",
            "#bfe8d2"
          ],
          "text": "RIA: \"Aneh... sebagian pasukan kita ngamuk sendiri. Musuh dalam selimut! Tenangkan medan, jangan sampai tubuh melukai dirinya sendiri.\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/ria_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.72,
                0.75
              ],
              "to": [
                0.72,
                0.35
              ],
              "scale": 0.3
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "brief_bab_kanker",
      "shots": [
        {
          "dur": 3200,
          "bg": [
            "#fff3e0",
            "#ffd9b0"
          ],
          "text": "Dr. Amara: \"Ada hasil yang perlu kita perhatikan lebih lanjut. Bukan berarti hal terburuk — tapi kita perlu waktu untuk memastikan.\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/amara_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.09999999999999998,
                0.52
              ],
              "to": [
                0.3,
                0.52
              ],
              "scale": 0.42
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "dur": 3200,
          "bg": [
            "#e7f6ee",
            "#bfe8d2"
          ],
          "text": "RIA: \"Ini... beda. Sel ini bukan penyusup dari luar. Dia bagian dari kita yang salah tumbuh. Kita nggak punya pilihan lain.\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/ria_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.72,
                0.75
              ],
              "to": [
                0.72,
                0.35
              ],
              "scale": 0.3
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "brief_bab_final",
      "shots": [
        {
          "dur": 3200,
          "bg": [
            "#fff3e0",
            "#ffd9b0"
          ],
          "text": "Dr. Amara: \"Malam ini penentuan. Aku di sini — dan 'pasukan' di dalam sana juga tidak akan menyerah.\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/amara_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.09999999999999998,
                0.52
              ],
              "to": [
                0.3,
                0.52
              ],
              "scale": 0.42
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "dur": 3200,
          "bg": [
            "#e7f6ee",
            "#bfe8d2"
          ],
          "text": "RIA: \"Semua ancaman yang pernah kita lawan, datang bersamaan. Satu malam. Satu tubuh. Satu kesempatan. Untuk Inang!\"",
          "actors": [
            {
              "sprite": "assets/sprites/ria_pose_talk.png",
              "from": [
                0.72,
                0.75
              ],
              "to": [
                0.72,
                0.35
              ],
              "scale": 0.3
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
